  "observations": [
    "SetCameraFrame invalidates camera and frame validity and projection hash before validation.",
    "Direction/up validity requires finite non-sentinel components, maximum absolute component > ON_ZERO_TOLERANCE and < ON_NONSENSE_WORLD_COORDINATE_VALUE.",
    "Up takes priority only when up is locked and direction is not; otherwise direction takes priority.",
    "Published Unitize/Length and cross-product operations are dependencies, with unit length and perpendicular guards at 1e-6.",
    "Failed frame construction retains prior basis fields while validity is false; no replacement identity basis.",
    "Location lock compares the exact requested point to existing valid location; invalid location input can retain previous state."
  ],
  "nextProof": [
    "Compile unchanged source frame/setter methods with exact published numeric dependencies, explicit state and diagnostic observations.",
    "Compare lock combinations, setter order, original four presets, zero/near-parallel/short/huge/nonfinite/sentinel cases and all retained fields.",
    "Only then integrate source lens/parallel-transition and world-normalized mesh transforms, followed by actual Metal preset captures."
  ],
